<title>UK: Oftel seeks cut in BT interconnect charges.</title>
<headline>Oftel seeks cut in BT interconnect charges.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-07-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>UK telecoms watchdog Oftel said on Wednesday that interconnect charges payable to British Telecommunications Plc should reflect a projected 28 percent reduction in BT's costs in the two years from 1995/96.</p>
</text>
